{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_1_Introducing.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introducing Furball Blitz!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join animal soldiers on a rogue-lite shooting mission through space, filled with bullets and sweat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you play, you'll embark on an adventure in which you must break through dangerous, bullet-filled areas while wielding different weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_2_Weapons.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current arsenal boasts over 50 unique options and is divided into four grades based on performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From pistols and bazookas to large-caliber rifles, cluster bombs, drone bombers... and even MIRVs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can arm yourself with a variety of non-traditional weapons rarely seen in typical first-person shooter games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can carry up to three weapons at once, enabling dynamic combat scenarios and thrilling battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_3_GameModes.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 50 unique weapons</strong><br>Bullets can curve, bounce, explode, and split. Anything is possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A diverse progression system</strong><br>Once you find your favorite weapon, upgrade it and add various options.<br>Create synergies with relics and active items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duo multiplayer support!</strong>Team up with friends to form a squad and cooperate!<br>Fight together, farm resources, and replenish ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue-lite dungeon crawling!</strong><br>Could you become legendary with just one good weapon combination this time?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_4_JoinUs.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute soldiers under your command transform into powerful warriors. <br>Combine weapons and relics to create your own unique build. Survive countless battles and return safely to your spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2897520?t=1749010694","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2897520?t=1749010694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/9ff6f70ce288b6c9e61d37fe3529cfa8533130db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749010694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/9ff6f70ce288b6c9e61d37fe3529cfa8533130db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749010694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_1_Introducing.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introducing Furball Blitz!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join animal soldiers on a rogue-lite shooting mission through space, filled with bullets and sweat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you play, you'll embark on an adventure in which you must break through dangerous, bullet-filled areas while wielding different weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_2_Weapons.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current arsenal boasts over 50 unique options and is divided into four grades based on performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From pistols and bazookas to large-caliber rifles, cluster bombs, drone bombers... and even MIRVs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can arm yourself with a variety of non-traditional weapons rarely seen in typical first-person shooter games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can carry up to three weapons at once, enabling dynamic combat scenarios and thrilling battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_3_GameModes.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 50 unique weapons</strong><br>Bullets can curve, bounce, explode, and split. Anything is possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A diverse progression system</strong><br>Once you find your favorite weapon, upgrade it and add various options.<br>Create synergies with relics and active items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duo multiplayer support!</strong>Team up with friends to form a squad and cooperate!<br>Fight together, farm resources, and replenish ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue-lite dungeon crawling!</strong><br>Could you become legendary with just one good weapon combination this time?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/extras/StoreDescription_4_JoinUs.png?t=1749010694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute soldiers under your command transform into powerful warriors. <br>Combine weapons and relics to create your own unique build. Survive countless battles and return safely to your spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["BlueTale"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897520/70a82017cd8884518782198b44164609cc988c97/header.jpg?t=1749010694","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257013948,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257013948/movie480.mp4?t=1749010479","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257013948/movie_max.mp4?t=1749010479"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer (E.A Footage)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257013948/12d0cab7dbf2011a8873a82ab83f249d793306a6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749010479","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257013948/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749010479","ma